data:{"type":"MESSAGES_SNAPSHOT","threadId":"vision-edge-noprop","runId":"r1","messages":[{"id":"msg_0057255650015jkGfdkYQeGVMR","role":"user","content":"用 render_a2ui 渲染 surfaceId=e-noprop：Column 根，含一个 MetricCard（id=m1，只给 title=\"本月销售额\"，故意不要给 value 和 delta）和一个 Text（写\"页面正常\"）。严格照做，不要补 value。"},{"id":"msg_005725583001X79UZ2qKrBUGQl-r","role":"reasoning","content":"The user wants me to render an A2UI surface with surfaceId=e-noprop, Column root containing a MetricCard (id=m1, only title=\"本月销售额\", intentionally no value and delta) and a Text with \"页面正常\".\n\nLet me follow the instructions strictly. The MetricCard props contract says `MetricCard{title,value,delta?,trend?}`. The user explicitly wants only title, no value, no delta.\n\nFor Column: `Column/Row{children:[id]}`. Root id must be \"root\".\n\nLet me build the flat component array."},{"id":"msg_005725583001X79UZ2qKrBUGQl","role":"assistant","content":"","toolCalls":[{"id":"call_00_W4NrK91atiZO4A5YHTqp8476","type":"function","function":{"name":"render_a2ui","arguments":"{\"surfaceId\":\"e-noprop\",\"components\":[{\"component\":\"Column\",\"id\":\"root\",\"children\":[\"m1\",\"t1\"]},{\"component\":\"MetricCard\",\"id\":\"m1\",\"title\":\"本月销售额\"},{\"component\":\"Text\",\"id\":\"t1\",\"text\":\"页面正常\"}]}"}}]},{"id":"toolres-call_00_W4NrK91atiZO4A5YHTqp8476","role":"tool","toolCallId":"call_00_W4NrK91atiZO4A5YHTqp8476","content":"UI surface \"e-noprop\" rendered (3 components). The user can already see it; do NOT paste the JSON back into chat."},{"id":"msg_005725eb30010LI6BuDC6WSo4A","role":"assistant","content":"已渲染 surface `e-noprop`：Column 根，含 MetricCard（仅 title）与 Text「页面正常」。"}]}

